{"seq":2,"slug":"automation-ci","title":"自动化与 CI 集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility/engineering/automation-ci","wordCount":1134,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"自动化与-ci-集成\">自动化与 CI 集成</h1><p>一次性的可访问性审计,寿命往往只有一个迭代。下个 Sprint，某个同事提交了一个用 div 拼的下拉菜单、删掉了一段焦点管理代码、把对比度合规的灰色调淡了一档——审计辛苦修好的东西悄无声息地退回去了。把可访问性检查嵌进 CI，本质上是用机器为「不退化」站岗：让违规像类型错误、单元测试失败一样，在合并前就变成一道红色的门。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>自动化可访问性的目标不是取代<a href=\"testing-audit\">人工审计</a>，而是把其中「能机器判定」的那 30-40% 固化成回归防线，让人力专注在工具查不到的体验问题上。它的核心引擎几乎都是同一个——<strong>axe-core</strong>，一个误报率极低、可被各种宿主调用的规则引擎。围绕它，检查被部署到开发流程的不同阶段，越早拦截成本越低：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[编辑器/编码时] --&gt; B[eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y&lt;br/&gt;静态检查源码]&#10;  B --&gt; C[单元/组件测试] --&gt; D[jest-axe / vitest-axe&lt;br/&gt;对渲染结果断言]&#10;  D --&gt; E[端到端测试] --&gt; F[Playwright + axe-core&lt;br/&gt;真实页面扫描]&#10;  F --&gt; G[CI 流水线] --&gt; H[违规则构建失败&lt;br/&gt;阻止合并]\">flowchart TD\n  A[编辑器/编码时] --&gt; B[eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y&lt;br/&gt;静态检查源码]\n  B --&gt; C[单元/组件测试] --&gt; D[jest-axe / vitest-axe&lt;br/&gt;对渲染结果断言]\n  D --&gt; E[端到端测试] --&gt; F[Playwright + axe-core&lt;br/&gt;真实页面扫描]\n  F --&gt; G[CI 流水线] --&gt; H[违规则构建失败&lt;br/&gt;阻止合并]</pre><p>这条「左移」流水线的原则是:同一类问题，越靠左(越早)被发现，修复成本越低；最理想的是在开发者敲完代码的那一刻，编辑器就标红。</p>\n<h2 id=\"第一层-编码时的静态检查\">第一层:编码时的静态检查</h2><p><code>eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y</code> 在 React/JSX 项目里做静态分析，开发者写代码时就在编辑器里看到警告:img 缺 alt、<code>onClick</code> 加在了非交互元素上、表单控件没关联 label。它的局限是只看源码、看不到运行时的真实 DOM 与动态状态，但作为「第一道、零成本」的防线极有价值。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"// .eslintrc：开启 jsx-a11y 推荐规则集&#10;{&#10;  &quot;extends&quot;: [&quot;plugin:jsx-a11y/recommended&quot;],&#10;  &quot;rules&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;jsx-a11y/no-static-element-interactions&quot;: &quot;error&quot;,&#10;    &quot;jsx-a11y/anchor-is-valid&quot;: &quot;error&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// .eslintrc：开启 jsx-a11y 推荐规则集</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"extends\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"plugin:jsx-a11y/recommended\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rules\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"jsx-a11y/no-static-element-interactions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"error\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"jsx-a11y/anchor-is-valid\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"error\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"第二层-测试里的断言\">第二层:测试里的断言</h2><p>把 axe-core 接进单元/组件测试，让每个组件渲染后自动跑一遍可访问性断言。React 生态用 <code>jest-axe</code>，Vitest 用 <code>vitest-axe</code>，断言通过才算测试通过:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"import { render } from &#39;@testing-library/react&#39;;&#10;import { axe, toHaveNoViolations } from &#39;jest-axe&#39;;&#10;expect.extend(toHaveNoViolations);&#10;&#10;test(&#39;对话框组件无可访问性违规&#39;, async () =&gt; {&#10;  const { container } = render(&lt;Dialog open title=&quot;确认删除&quot; /&gt;);&#10;  const results = await axe(container);&#10;  // 任何 axe 违规都会让这条测试失败&#10;  expect(results).toHaveNoViolations();&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { render } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@testing-library/react'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { axe, toHaveNoViolations } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'jest-axe'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">expect.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">extend</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(toHaveNoViolations);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'对话框组件无可访问性违规'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">container</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> render</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Dialog</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> open</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> title</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"确认删除\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> />);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> results</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> axe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(container);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 任何 axe 违规都会让这条测试失败</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(results).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toHaveNoViolations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这一层的价值是把可访问性变成组件的「合约」:谁改坏了 <a href=\"../aria/accessible-widgets\">对话框的 ARIA</a>，对应测试立刻红。它仍受限于 jsdom——查不出真实浏览器里的焦点行为与对比度渲染，这些要交给下一层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"第三层-端到端扫描\">第三层:端到端扫描</h2><p>在 Playwright 或 Cypress 的端到端测试里注入 axe-core，对真实浏览器渲染的完整页面扫描，能覆盖真实的对比度、运行时 DOM 与跨页流程:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"import { test, expect } from &#39;@playwright/test&#39;;&#10;import AxeBuilder from &#39;@axe-core/playwright&#39;;&#10;&#10;test(&#39;结账页符合 WCAG 2.2 AA&#39;, async ({ page }) =&gt; {&#10;  await page.goto(&#39;/checkout&#39;);&#10;  const results = await new AxeBuilder({ page })&#10;    .withTags([&#39;wcag2a&#39;, &#39;wcag2aa&#39;, &#39;wcag22aa&#39;]) // 锁定要测的级别&#10;    .analyze();&#10;  expect(results.violations).toEqual([]);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { test, expect } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@playwright/test'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AxeBuilder </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@axe-core/playwright'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'结账页符合 WCAG 2.2 AA'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">page</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> page.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">goto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/checkout'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> results</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AxeBuilder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ page })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">withTags</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'wcag2a'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'wcag2aa'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'wcag22aa'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 锁定要测的级别</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">analyze</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(results.violations).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toEqual</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>withTags</code> 让你精确选择要强制的 WCAG 级别，与<a href=\"../foundations/wcag-standards\">基础章定的合规目标</a>对齐——通常锁定 wcag2aa 与 wcag22aa。</p>\n<h2 id=\"各层能力与盲区对照\">各层能力与盲区对照</h2><p>下表把四层的覆盖范围与共同盲区讲清，避免对自动化产生过度信任:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>覆盖</th>\n<th>仍查不到</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>编码时</td>\n<td>eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y</td>\n<td>源码层面的明显错误</td>\n<td>运行时状态、对比度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单元/组件</td>\n<td>jest-axe / vitest-axe</td>\n<td>组件渲染后的 ARIA、结构</td>\n<td>真实焦点、真实对比度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>端到端</td>\n<td>Playwright + axe-core</td>\n<td>真实 DOM、对比度、跨页</td>\n<td>朗读体验、焦点逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全部自动化</td>\n<td>axe-core 系</td>\n<td>约 30-40% 的 WCAG</td>\n<td>60-70% 须<a href=\"testing-audit\">人工审计</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行是必须时刻记住的:即便四层全绿，仍只覆盖了三四成准则。朗读是否通顺、焦点顺序是否合逻辑、键盘能否走完流程，依旧要靠<a href=\"../perception/screen-readers\">屏幕阅读器走查</a>与<a href=\"testing-audit\">键盘走查</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"在-ci-里管理违规而非制造噪音\">在 CI 里管理违规而非制造噪音</h2><p>把检查接进 CI 容易，难的是不让它变成被团队无视的噪音。三条实践:其一，设置<strong>基线(baseline)</strong>——对存量违规先记录、不阻断，只对「新增」违规亮红，避免一上来就几百个失败把团队劝退;其二，把可访问性测试纳入必过的 PR 检查(required check)，而非可选的附加项;其三，违规报告要给出可定位的元素与修复建议(axe 的输出自带帮助链接)，降低修复门槛。CI 自动化是<a href=\"inclusive-process\">包容性流程</a>的技术支柱，但它只能守住「不退化」——让团队主动把可访问性做进设计与需求，仍需流程与文化，那是下一篇的主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>自动化用同一引擎 axe-core，分编码时(jsx-a11y)、组件(jest-axe)、端到端(Playwright)三层左移部署，越早拦截越省成本。</li>\n<li>各层能力递进:静态查源码、组件查渲染结构、端到端查真实对比度与跨页流程。</li>\n<li><code>withTags</code> 锁定 WCAG 级别，与团队的合规目标对齐(通常 wcag2aa + wcag22aa)。</li>\n<li>四层全绿仍只覆盖约 30-40% 准则，朗读与焦点逻辑必须靠<a href=\"testing-audit\">人工审计</a>补足。</li>\n<li>CI 落地靠基线管理存量、设为必过检查、给可定位的修复建议;它守「不退化」，主动做进流程靠<a href=\"inclusive-process\">包容性流程与团队</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自动化与 CI 集成","id":"自动化与-ci-集成"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"第一层:编码时的静态检查","id":"第一层-编码时的静态检查"},{"level":2,"text":"第二层:测试里的断言","id":"第二层-测试里的断言"},{"level":2,"text":"第三层:端到端扫描","id":"第三层-端到端扫描"},{"level":2,"text":"各层能力与盲区对照","id":"各层能力与盲区对照"},{"level":2,"text":"在 CI 里管理违规而非制造噪音","id":"在-ci-里管理违规而非制造噪音"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"测试与审计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility/engineering/testing-audit"},"next":{"title":"包容性流程与团队","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility/engineering/inclusive-process"}}